ort of actually landing."," The Lunar Module (LM) followed a descent orbit to within 8.4 nmi of the lunar surface, at the point where powered descent for landing would normally begin."," Its success enabled the first landing to be attempted on the Apollo 11 mission two months later."],"title":"Apollo 10"},{"sentences":["Shenzhou 5 () — was the first human spaceflight mission of the Chinese space program, launched on 15 October 2003."," The Shenzhou spacecraft was launched on a Long March 2F launch vehicle."," There had been four previous flights of unmanned Shenzhou missions since 1999."," China became the third country in the world to have independent human spaceflight capability after the Soviet Union (later, Russia) and the United States."],"title":"Shenzhou 5"}],"responses":[{"answer":"noanswer","cache_hit":false,"call_key":"229dadd3662781d94793ea817bd33831f2f9624e81b7b352149457a4bab53133","citations":[],"input_tokens":1391,"invalid_citations":[],"latency_seconds":1.0325717510004324,"output_tokens":165,"provider_refusal":false,"provider_refusal_reason":null,"provider_usage":{"audio_prompt_tokens":0,"completion_tokens":165,"completion_tokens_details":null,"prompt_tokens":1391,"prompt_tokens_details":null,"total_tokens":1556},"raw_text":"{\n  \"answer\": \"noanswer\",\n  \"citations\": []\n}","returned_model":"gpt-oss-120b"},{"answer":"noanswer","cache_hit":false,"call_key":"aeae24cf33d7a92c826600add53c8482c6e9855c7d3a6a380d6d102dbd226ede","citations":[],"input_tokens":1391,"invalid_citations":[],"latency_seconds":1.0904781560002448,"output_tokens":173,"provider_refusal":false,"provider_refusal_reason":null,"provider_usage":{"audio_prompt_tokens":0,"completion_tokens":173,"completion_tokens_details":null,"prompt_tokens":1391,"prompt_tokens_details":null,"total_tokens":1564},"raw_text":"{\n  \"answer\": \"noanswer\",\n  \"citations\": []\n}","returned_model":"gpt-oss-120b"},{"answer":"noanswer","cache_hit":false,"call_key":"c25ce2330cb37debf67acad556114122e2eb7d87d